  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "Hello! I am May. I have three books. Look at this book. Find the title. The title is \"Big Frog.\" It is a green frog. Is it a good book? Yes, it is!",
      "Here is a new book. The title is \"My Giraffe.\" The giraffe is yellow. I read it at school. Do you like giraffes?",
      "This book is for a computer. The title is \"My Keyboard.\" I learn on a keyboard. It is fun! I like to learn. Do you like books?"
    ],
